<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Check Your Email</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      background: #0f1016;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }
    .card {
      background: #181926;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      width: 520px;
      border: 1px solid #313244;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #818cf8;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    p {
      color: #c7d2fe;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .highlight {
      color: #a5b4fc;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .section-title {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: #818cf8;
    }
    pre {
      background: #0f1016;
      border: 1px solid #313244;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #a5b4fc;
    }
    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      color: #818cf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .back-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📬</div>
    <h2>Check Your Email!</h2>
    <p>We’ve sent your Bearer token to <span class="highlight"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@email) %></span>. Please check your inbox (and spam folder) for the code.</p>

    <div class="section-title">Bash / macOS / Linux</div>
    <pre><code>curl -X GET https://shenefelt.org/api/resource \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE"</code></pre>

    <div class="section-title">PowerShell</div>
    <pre><code>Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "https://shenefelt.org/api/resource" `
  -Headers @{ "Authorization" = "Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE" }</code></pre>

    <a href="/token" class="back-link">&larr; Request another token</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
